# Per-device configuration (WiFi, server URL, device ID, TZ, etc.) is
# provisioned into NVS via `tools/provision.py` — there is no longer a
# .env used at firmware build time. Copy tools/devices/example.yaml to
# tools/devices/<your-device>.yaml and run `just provision <your-device>`.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so `dotenv-load` in the Justfile
# doesn't complain when .env is absent.
